OL,3,GNEWSANew sniffer dog team to detect
OL,4,Adrugs used in spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police forces have teamed up to
OL,7,Fform a dog team tasked with identifying
OL,8,Fpeople involved in spiking.
OL,10,FThames Valley Police and Hampshire
OL,11,Fpolice say the specially trained dogs
OL,12,Fwill help protect students across the
OL,13,Fregion's university cities.
OL,15,FThe forces say the six canines -
OL,16,FMaverick, Puma, Dusty, AJ, Reggie and
OL,17,FMajor - can all detect drugs linked to
OL,18,Fspiking, including those carried in
OL,19,Fsmall quantities or liquid form.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
