OL,3,GNEWSANew sniffer dog team to detect
OL,4,Adrugs used in spiking
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpiking is a criminal offence that can
OL,7,Fcarry a jail sentence of up to 10
OL,8,Fyears, but dog-handler PC Dan Honey
OL,9,Fsaid it was often "very difficult" to
OL,10,Fidentify potential offenders.
